  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Norway Strategic Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Norway and CAFOD have identified that it is mutually beneficial to enter into a strategic partnership, the basis of which is outlined in this Memorandum of Understanding. Mutual benefits will be realised as the two agencies work together across a number of organisational functions with a view to enhancing each organisation&#x2019;s ability to deliver its humanitarian and, where appropriate, development programmes.  A range of specific activities will be agreed mutually and be delivered in partnership, within the following organisational functional areas:
 
Security management, institutional fund-raising, humanitarian advocacy, supporter development. 
 
There will be a particular focus on activities associated with CAFOD and Caritas Norway&#x2019;s engagement within the following countries: Central African Republic (CAR), South Sudan, Democratic Republic of Congo (DRC), Eritrea, Syria, the Philippines.</narrative>
  </description>
